      "description": "Replai - Transform Your Legacy Systems with AI Skip to content Replai Platform Solutions System integrators Company Resources Let’s talk The living knowledge platform Your code. Understood. Decades of business knowledge, hiding in plain sight. Replai brings it to life so you can understand your systems, change with confidence, and build what comes next. See Replai in action Explore the platform Your knowledge. Your environment. Your control. COBOL · Oracle Forms · Java · .NET + more Made for mission-critical. Built for your next chapter. Banking Insurance Enterprise System integrators What Replai Actually Does Most legacy systems carry decades of business logic that nobody fully understands anymore. The original developers are gone, the documentation is incomplete, and making changes feels risky. Replai reads your existing code - COBOL, Oracle Forms, PL/I, and others - and builds a structured map of what the system actually does: the business rules, the workflows, the dependencies between components. Your team can then ask plain-language questions about that code, trace how changes will ripple through the system, and plan modernization work without guessing. The result is a team that can safely extend, refactor, or migrate legacy systems without needing someone who remembers how things were built 30 years ago . Meet your living knowledge base A clearer picture. A smarter next move. From a question about one field to a plan for your entire estate. It starts with understanding. Workspace 0 1 Understand 0 2 Trace impact 0 3 Modernize 0 4 Your work. A connected view. See what needs your attention, pick up a conversation, and follow work in progress. A shared starting point for understanding and modernizing your systems. Explore the possibilities Replai / Workspace Questions, decisions, and progress in one workspace Prototype · Sample data Understanding changes everything Beyond translation. Into business meaning. A line-by-line rewrite carries the past forward. A semantic knowledge layer gives you the understanding to choose a better future. A closer look Knowledge flow Change impact 01 / Your systems Start with the source Source code Metadata Dependencies Across your existing stack 02 / Analysis agents Recover the meaning Read structure Recover rules Map relationships Specialized analysis, working together 03 / Replai Living knowledge Rules, workflows, and relationships. Connected to their source. One shared semantic layer 04 / Your team Put it to work Ask & explore Trace impact Plan & modernize Human judgment stays in the loop From code to context A conceptual view of how Replai turns technical detail into knowledge your team can use. 01 / Starting field Payment amount PAYMENT-AMOUNT The value you are considering changing 02 / Business rule Calculate net payment NET = AMOUNT − FEE The rule uses the starting field to calculate a new value. Linked to source evidence 03 / Connected records Ledger entry Records the net amount Audit record Retains the payment detail Illustrative example Follow the relationships, then inspect the evidence. This example is not a complete blast radius. Recover the why. Connect technical components to their business purpose. Keep your options open. Rebuild in the architecture and technology that fit your future. Make knowledge usable. Give developers, architects, and business teams a shared view. Where clarity becomes progress Big questions. Practical answers. All solutions 01 Business understanding Understand the undocumented. Recover lost metadata and make unfamiliar business logic accessible to your team. 02 Change & risk Follow the impact. Trace data lineage and dependencies before changing a field, a formula, or an entire workflow. 03 Compliance & audit Make your evidence visible. Explore rules and source context to support audit and regulatory reviews. 04 Modernization Modernize on your terms. Plan and execute migration with business intent, not just syntax, as your foundation