      "description": "Replai - Transform Your Legacy Systems with AI Skip to content Replai Platform Solutions System integrators Company Resources Let’s talk For system integrators Less guesswork. More great delivery. Turn complex modernization engagements into a repeatable practice. Discover faster, scope with context, and deliver with the business logic in view. Become a partner Meet the team The complexity is real. The uncertainty can change. Modernization projects are labor-intensive and hard to estimate when the system is a black box. Replai’s semantic knowledge layer changes the starting point, from archaeology to understanding. Legacy talent Timelines Scope Execution risk Profitability Win rate Knowledge shouldn’t leave with the expert. When experienced developers are scarce, understanding becomes the bottleneck. Give your team source-backed business context they can share, question, and build on. Explore the capabilities A shared foundation for every phase 01 / Discovery & estimation Turn source code, metadata, and dependencies into an explorable picture of the engagement. 02 / AI-assisted development Use recovered business meaning to guide prompts, extensions, and implementation in the target architecture. 03 / Verification & delivery Keep changes connected to their intent. Review outputs, validate behavior, and make the next decision with context. 04 / Ongoing maintenance Keep the knowledge useful after a milestone ships, for the next developer, change, and modernization wave. Better together. From the first project. Replai works with system integrators on customer modernization engagements. Our platform makes existing systems understandable so teams can focus on the work that moves a project forward. Bring your delivery expertise. We’ll bring the semantic knowledge foundation. Shared system understanding Repeatable discovery and delivery Flexibility in target architectures Let’s build together What This Looks Like on a Real Project A team of four developers takes on an Oracle Forms migration. In week one, they point Replai at the existing codebase. The platform's semantic knowledge layer maps every form, trigger, and business rule - producing the kind of system understanding that would normally take weeks of manual code reading. The team knows exactly what they're dealing with before writing a single line of new code. By week three, they're using Replai's AI-assisted development to extend functionality in the target architecture, with the recovered business logic guiding each prompt. Hidden dependencies are already documented. Scope surprises don't materialize. The first milestone ships ahead of schedule. The client sees working software earlier than expected. The SI protects its margins because the team stayed lean and the estimate held. Replai New possibilities. Already in your code. Explore Platform Languages & platforms Solutions Oracle Forms & APEX System integrators Replai About us Careers Resources Contact Trust Trust center Privacy policy Terms of service License agreement © 2026 Replai. All rights reserved. Made for what comes next.",
