      "description": "Replai for Oracle APEX - Forms-to-APEX migration. Vibe programming. Mission Critical Reborn. Skip to content Replai Platform Solutions System integrators Company Resources Let’s talk Oracle Forms · PL/SQL · APEX Mission-critical. Ready for what’s next. Forms-to-APEX migration and AI-assisted development, grounded in the business knowledge inside your portfolio. Talk to our team Explore the approach One connected view of your portfolio. Replai is a canonical AI layer for Oracle Forms, PL/SQL, and APEX. We reconstruct intent, dependencies, and business logic, then run agents on top of that knowledge. Forms-to-APEX migration Dependency-aware wave planning, verification gates, and agents that reason against a unified knowledge graph. Source and target in one model. AI-assisted APEX development Generate, refactor, and extend APEX and PL/SQL with system context. Ground proposed changes in real dependencies, not just file-level hints. Auditable agent workflows Trace, govern, and review agent actions. Built for teams where every change needs to be explained. Knowledge that crosses languages Bring COBOL, Natural, PowerBuilder, .NET, Java, and 4GL systems into a shared understanding. From source to a considered change. Migrations progress in waves informed by complexity. Development is grounded in dependencies, and every action stays connected to an auditable workflow. 01 / Ingest Source code, runtime traces, documentation, and tickets. 02 / Understand A canonical layer of business intent and dependencies. 03 / Act Agents that assist migration, generation, and verification. 04 / Review An audit trail for the team to inspect and govern. Go a little deeper. Explore the architecture, methodology, and a proposed proof of concept in our Oracle APEX overview. Download the one-pager From APEX Connect 2026: Heide Park, Soltau, May 18–20. Replai participated as a sponsor with a 45-minute session. Conference details Book an APEX walkthrough Your next chapter There