      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.replaitech.ai/about",
      "description": "Replai - Transform Your Legacy Systems with AI Skip to content Replai Platform Solutions System integrators Company Resources Let’s talk About Replai The future shouldn’t forget the past. We’re making the knowledge inside mission-critical systems accessible, understandable, and ready for what comes next. Our Mission Mission-critical systems power the world's critical infrastructure, yet understanding and modernizing them remains one of the biggest challenges in enterprise technology. At Replai, we're building the AI-native platform that connects every technical component to its business meaning, making mission-critical systems accessible, understandable, and ready for the future. Why We Built This The founding team came out of HP, Meta, Microsoft, Sapiens, and several leading AI companies. Across those careers, they kept running into the same problem: enterprises running on systems that no single person fully understood. Core banking platforms. Insurance policy engines. Logistics infrastructure. Decades of business logic accumulated in COBOL, PL/I, and aging Java codebases, with the original authors long gone and the documentation either missing or wrong. Modernization projects kept stalling for the same reason. Teams would start with good intentions, then spend months just trying to understand what the existing system actually did before writing a single line of new code. Some projects failed outright. Others delivered a fraction of what was promised, because critical business rules stayed buried and got lost in translation. Replai exists to fix that specific problem. The platform maps the business meaning inside legacy codebases so modernization teams can see what they're working with before they touch anything. That's the foundation every enterprise code modernization project needs, and the one that has consistently been missing. What guides us Curiosity. Depth. Real impact. Innovation Push the boundaries of AI and semantic understanding to solve problems that have challenged the industry for decades. Expertise Combine deep technical knowledge with real-world experience in legacy modernization. Trust Treat enterprise security, privacy, and the integrity of business knowledge as foundational. Impact Measure success by the teams we empower and the modernization work we help move forward. Help write the next chapter. We’re bringing curious engineers and experienced architects together to make complex systems understandable. Explore careers Replai New possibilities. Already in your code. Explore Platform Languages & platforms Solutions Oracle Forms & APEX System integrators Replai About us Careers Resources Contact Trust Trust center Privacy policy Terms of service License agreement © 2026 Replai. All rights reserved. Made for what comes next.",
